	<section_number>6.2-881</section_number>
	<catch_line>Investment in reverse annuity mortgages</catch_line>
	<text>
		A bank may invest in reverse annuity mortgages to the extent and in the manner that may be provided in regulations adopted by the Commission.
	</text>
	<history>1979, c. 386, § 6.1-65.1; 1994, c. 501; 2010, c. 794.</history>
